    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d220">

                <pb facs="0496" n="412" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg412"/>

                <head>No. 216.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The President
                        to the Queen.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Executive Mansion</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1886-09-04"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 4,
                        1886</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">To Victoria</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Queen and Empress, Balmoral, Scotland:</hi></p>
                <p>Your Majesty’s expression of sympathy for the sufferers by the earthquake is
                    warmly appreciated and awakes grateful response in American hearts.</p>
                <closer><signed>GROVER CLEVELAND,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                        >President.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
